              <div class="cc-prompt"><span class="p">❯</span><span>How did orders in Norway change in October 2026?</span></div>
              <div class="cc-body">
                <div class="cc-called">Called footnote</div>
                <div class="cc-bullet">I can't give you the October 2026 order numbers. Here is what applies to orders in Norway in October 2026.</div>
                <ul>
                  <li><b>Online sales stopped on 4 August 2026.</b> A new customs rule holds parcels from webshops outside Norway at the border "until further notice". The Sales owner checked this.</li>
                  <li><b>Don't read fewer orders as fewer customers.</b> The written caveat is that the drop after 4 August does not mean fewer customers.</li>
                  <li><b>Compare in euros.</b> Orders are booked in each market's own currency and converted to euros at the daily rate.</li>
                </ul>
                <div>Nothing is written down about a specific event in October 2026. That only covers what I asked, and it doesn't prove nothing happened.</div>
              </div>
              <div class="cc-foot">✳ Worked for 10s</div>
            </div>
          </figure>
