<div class="amd wide">
          <div class="amd-txt">
            <h3>One line in your AGENTS.md</h3>
            <p class="prose">When you connect an agent, the prompt the app gives you adds one line to the project's instructions file: CLAUDE.md if you have one, otherwise AGENTS.md. That's all you write.</p>
            <p class="prose">How to explain the why isn't left to that file. Footnote sends the rules with every reply, so each agent gets the same ones, and they change with the server rather than in every repository.</p>
          </div>
