        <h2 class="h2" id="h-install">Try it on your own computer.</h2>
        <!-- release: switch to the images -->
        <p class="lede">You need Docker. The first start builds Footnote from your checkout and loads the demo company: its people and their notes, a few suggestions waiting for review, and some weeks of questions from agents. The first build takes a few minutes.</p>
<div class="install wide" id="install">
          <div class="inst">
            <span class="n">1</span>
            <!-- release: switch to the images -->
            <div><h3>Start it</h3><p>Clone the repository and start it with Docker Compose.</p></div>
<div class="cmdw"><button class="copy" type="button" aria-label="Copy the commands" data-copy="git clone https://github.com/Fredehagelund92/footnote.git &amp;&amp; cd footnote&#10;docker compose up"><svg><use href="#i-copy"/></svg></button><pre class="cmd"><span class="p">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/Fredehagelund92/footnote.git &amp;&amp; cd footnote
<span class="p">$ </span>docker compose up</pre></div>
